            <ArticleTitle>Travel advice for clients with pre-existing medical conditions.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>41-7; quiz 48-50</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Overseas travel, especially long-haul, can have risks that are not only associated with infection but also the mode of transport, climate, lifestyle and conditions at the destination. These risks may be magnified if the individual has a pre-existing medical condition.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
